{"availability":"available","full":"BR1JM0H4N/Hd-Patch","name":"Hd-Patch","description":"Put your HD original back into an outpainted image — seamlessly and locally.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T08:49:46Z","updated":"2026-10-12T19:45:20Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://br1jm0h4n.github.io/Hd-Patch/","topics":["android","android-app","android-application","apk","apk-build","capacitor","capacitor-android","github-actions","github-pages","html-css-javascript","image-analysis","image-processing","image-recognition","photo-editor","pwa","pwa-app"],"demo":"https://br1jm0h4n.github.io/Hd-Patch/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T21:14:11.372Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T21:14:11.372Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T21:14:11.372Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:15.286Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:14:11.372Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Put your sharp HD original back into an outpainted image, seamlessly and 100% on your device.","AI outpainting tools (Generative Fill, Gemini, Stable Diffusion and friends) are great at extending a picture, but they hand back a downscaled, compressed result. Your carefully made HD original ends up blurry inside the bigger canvas.","HD Patch fixes that. Give it the low-res outpainted picture and your crisp original, and it:"],"features":["🔎 Finds exactly where the original sits, using multi-scale Normalized Cross-Correlation (NCC) with sub-pixel refinement.","📐 Upscales the outpainted image so the original lines up 1:1, which means your HD pixels are never resized in the default output.","🎨 Blends the sharp pixels back in, with local color matching and a soft edge so there's no visible box.","Alignment handles scale and position. If your outpainted image was also rotated or warped, use the manual controls to finish."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BR1JM0H4N/Hd-Patch/blob/